summary:
  The ladder dates its first knock by now instead of the last moment heard.

history:
  The 2026.40 hole itself: a death noticed at eight stamped eight, and the
  replay thirty seconds later found the order fresh.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          if (root._healRetryAttempts === 0) root._orderQuietSince = RetryLogic.orderSince(0, root._orderHeardAt, Date.now());

replace:
          if (root._healRetryAttempts === 0) root._orderQuietSince = Date.now();

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_a_standing_order_cannot_outlive_a_night_asleep.
  Line-neutral.
